eatest displacement: a greater case triggers rejection, while equality with the greatest case is the only passing arithmetic condition. This resolves the prior issue without losing the numeric or metric-unit restrictions enforced by the nested quantity shape.\",\n      \"candidate_location\": {\n        \"candidate_version\": 2,\n        \"candidate_sha256\": \"823c65db62106f8b2c8f2fab358ee1f7b9de76fce380965915eeda6bc315164a\",\n        \"unit\": \"lines\",\n        \"start\": 46,\n        \"end\": 76\n      },\n      \"previous_location\": {\n        \"candidate_version\": 1,\n        \"candidate_sha256\": \"d8986fa2c5186ae5d619696650e5f56328480bc5c3430465c4fdbc1ef9d94f9a\",\n        \"unit\": \"lines\",\n        \"start\": 46,\n        \"end\": 65\n      },\n      \"removal_disposition\": \"REPLACED\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reconciliations\": [\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"I2-004-LOGIC-001\",\n      \"state\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"source_evidence_id\": \"E66\",\n      \"source_excerpt\": \"Where multiple waterlines are used for determining the UIWL, the\",\n      \"reason\": \"Version 2 replaces the prior greater-than-only test with a disjunction that rejects any greater case and also rejects the absence of an equal case. Consequently, a DUI passes only when it equals a valid case displacement and no valid case displacement is greater, which represents the greatest case displacement required by the source.\",\n      \"candidate_location\": {\n        \"candidate_version\": 2,\n        \"candidate_sha256\": \"823c65db62106f8b2c8f2fab358ee1f7b9de76fce380965915eeda6bc315164a\",\n        \"unit\": \"lines\",\n        \"start\": 46,\n        \"end\": 76\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unchecked\": []\n}",
